{
 "format": 1,
 "name": "beethoven-agents",
 "repository": "OpenSpineConsortium/beethoven-agents",
 "summary": "The Beethoven engine's nested agentic framework: the substrate image, the guard, bee's accounts and the orchestration of Claude Code steps as Slurm jobs.",
